<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-004-A habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.259204" lon="-120.912987"><name>SC26-004-A</name><desc>North Buchon rocky rise Strong relief on rough rock north of the Point Buchon MPAs. Terrain A 98/100; not catch probability. Center 61 ft; nearby 47–105 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. About 558 m north of the Point Buchon closure boundary; closest marker to a screened closure. The 100 m circle leaves about 458 m. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-029</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.26240369289775" lon="-120.91295994563365"/><trkpt lat="35.262324955433265" lon="-120.91362145271036"/><trkpt lat="35.26178429210139" lon="-120.91363531676066"/><trkpt lat="35.26178050155952" lon="-120.91341558629819"/><trkpt lat="35.26141626846877" lon="-120.91320510031517"/><trkpt lat="35.26087750065641" lon="-120.91332883065611"/><trkpt lat="35.26098656036514" lon="-120.91442516143374"/><trkpt lat="35.26135268569953" lon="-120.9147455167086"/><trkpt lat="35.261360261475055" lon="-120.91518497573752"/><trkpt lat="35.26163438076111" lon="-120.91539777931831"/><trkpt lat="35.26128340454537" lon="-120.91595633746991"/><trkpt lat="35.2600351028209" lon="-120.91675769036034"/><trkpt lat="35.25877355196449" lon="-120.91678998789699"/><trkpt lat="35.25873286554799" lon="-120.90920726048527"/><trkpt lat="35.25918151815109" lon="-120.9090858225171"/><trkpt lat="35.26035864974473" lon="-120.90938530970885"/><trkpt lat="35.260291319721254" lon="-120.91070598044473"/><trkpt lat="35.260481028170226" lon="-120.91125066935393"/><trkpt lat="35.25976014458646" lon="-120.9112691744067"/><trkpt lat="35.2597677326911" lon="-120.91170862386389"/><trkpt lat="35.25958751173006" lon="-120.91171324905284"/><trkpt lat="35.25969089751361" lon="-120.91247997255866"/><trkpt lat="35.2599612290806" lon="-120.91247303727945"/><trkpt lat="35.26003616722604" lon="-120.91159182325944"/><trkpt lat="35.26075894787124" lon="-120.91168318459077"/><trkpt lat="35.26077222370186" lon="-120.91245223088775"/><trkpt lat="35.26104255521569" lon="-120.91244529523917"/><trkpt lat="35.26129581655452" lon="-120.91144957922161"/><trkpt lat="35.261092823046745" lon="-120.91013583575177"/><trkpt lat="35.261363154146444" lon="-120.91012889232829"/><trkpt lat="35.26210491322732" lon="-120.91131889608948"/><trkpt lat="35.26240369289775" lon="-120.91295994563365"/></trkseg></trk><trk><name>SC-DRIFT-004</name><desc>Principal axis of raised mapped rough habitat within 180 m of target. Optional structure alignment; actual drift depends on measured wind/current. Not a navigation route.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.258962864738436" lon="-120.91192819868375"/><trkpt lat="35.25944512619717" lon="-120.91404580803477"/></trkseg></trk></gpx>
